  "description": "Add a magical fairy tale touch to your designs with this whimsical princess prince watercolor clipart featuring adorable royal characters in a soft hand-painted style. These illustrations bring a dreamy, elegant, and charming aesthetic perfect for fantasy and celebration creative projects.\nThis princess prince clipart bundle is ideal for birthday invitations, baby shower decor, nursery wall art, stickers, sublimation designs, scrapbooking, junk journals, greeting cards, planners, DIY crafts, printable wall art, girls room decor, and handmade shop products. The whimsical style makes it perfect for fairy tale themes, royal celebrations, and cute fantasy artwork.\nWhat’s Included:\n✔ PNG files (transparent background)\n✔ JPG files (white background)\n✔ High resolution 300 DPI\n✔ Individual elements\n✔ Instant digital download  \nPerfect For:\n• Birthday party invitations\n• Baby shower decor\n• Nursery wall art\n• Sticker designs\n• Scrapbooking\n• Junk journaling\n• Greeting cards\n• Planner stickers\n• DIY crafts\n• Fairy tale projects  \nCommercial Use:\nThis clipart bundle may be used for personal and commercial projects. Perfect for creating handmade products, printable designs, nursery decor, and adorable royal-themed artwork.",
